# Normalize line endings to LF everywhere: in the repository and in the working
# tree on every platform. Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default)
# rewrites checked-out files to CRLF, which the hygiene gate rejects and which puts
# CRLF into anything packed from the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.tgz binary
*.zstd binary
